<title>AUSTRALIA: BHP Minerals chief Carter to retire.</title>
<headline>BHP Minerals chief Carter to retire.</headline>
<dateline>MELBOURNE 1997-08-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Broken Hill Pty Co Ltd said on Wednesday that the executive general manager of BHP Minerals Dick Carter is to retire from August 31.  </p>
<p>BHP said an announcement about appointments following Carter's retirement would be made in the near future.</p>
<p>-- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
</text>
